WEBVTT

00:00:03.206 --> 00:00:07.910
Open the assistant that should call the agent, and open its Capabilities tab.

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:13.406
The Agents section lists every agent that you can use, including the ones of other systems.

00:00:13.858 --> 00:00:15.858
Tick the agent, and save.

00:00:15.858 --> 00:00:19.598
From now on, the assistant can hand a request to it.

